WEBVTT

00:12:29.419 --> 00:12:31.152
for the confused teenager.

00:12:31.458 --> 00:12:34.902
A little easier for your friend
on the phone, worried that she's broken.

00:12:36.363 --> 00:12:39.235
A little easier and safer

00:12:39.259 --> 00:12:41.902
for the survivors, one in three women.

00:12:41.926 --> 00:12:43.076
One in six men.

00:12:43.648 --> 00:12:45.581
Half of trans folks.

00:12:46.633 --> 00:12:47.783
Me too.

00:12:48.514 --> 00:12:50.978
So for every brave conversation you have,

00:12:52.601 --> 00:12:53.752
thank you.

00:12:53.776 --> 00:13:00.720
(Applause)